Chapter: MathbookNotebookConsole
  cites Mathbook chapter Notebook
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 The console notebook, fed from the .stdin sidecar. The second line reads the
 binding the first made, so a notebook that forgot its environment answers
 `x + 4` rather than 7.

